Objective
Build an ongoing subscription and recurring-payment discovery app for individuals and invited family/friends. Present a consolidated single-page inventory, spending, renewal dates, ownership and evidence.

This handoff consolidates a real discovery exercise. It is NOT a completed financial audit. Treat historical findings as candidates and verify them against original records before importing as confirmed current subscriptions.

User context and requirements
India-first; INR default. Preserve original currencies.

Discover direct merchant subscriptions, UPI Autopay, recurring card payments, Google Play, Apple billing, memberships, trials and annual plans.

Support invited family/friends; distinguish account owner, payer and beneficiaries.

Monitor changes continuously rather than running a one-off keyword scan.

Show evidence, freshness, unresolved fields and audit coverage.

Never infer absence from a limited search result.

